<title>USA: Warwick, R.I., $9 million deal A1 by Moody's.</title>
<headline>Warwick, R.I., $9 million deal A1 by Moody's.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Feb 24 - Moody's Investors Service - Rating Announcement As of 02/21/97.</p>
<p>    Issuer		: Warwick</p>
<p>    State		 : RI</p>
<p>    Rating		: A1</p>
<p>    Sale Amount	 : 9,000,000</p>
<p>Expected Sale Date: 02/25/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
